/-!
# Computational Library Umbrella

Root of the default `Computational` library: game-based (VCVio) specifications and proofs of
libsignal's cryptographic security, binary refinement lemmas, and Lemmas 1–3
(`Computational/Theorems/Lemmas.lean`). Lemma 4 and the Main Theorem
(`Computational/Theorems/Main.lean`) are built by `CliElfLib`, and computational tests by
`ComputationalTests` (`Computational/Tests.lean`). See `Computational/docs/TRUSTED_BASE.md` for the
trusted base.
-/

